  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>v</mi></math> and <math><mi>a</mi></math> denote the displacement, the velocity and the acceleration of a particle executing simple harmonic motion of time period <math><mi>T</mi></math> , then which of the following do not change with time?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>v</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> In option ,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />So, according to the result above relation does not depend on time."
